{19}{[He looks you over.]  I don't know who you are, stranger.  But more importantly, you're a terrible liar.  And bein' a part of the Clan Maug is about the stupidest thing a bloke could lie about.  You get out of here real fast, and I might forget to tell anyone about it...}{[He looks you over.]  I don't know who you are, wench.  But more importantly, you're a terrible liar.  And bein' a part of the Clan Maug is about the stupidest thing that you could lie about.  You get out of here real fast, and I might forget to tell anyone about it...}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
